              "message": "The two-state terminal contract is still not propagated through this SSoT. Step 11 calls the condition an “explicit zero-findings terminal state” even though Accepted Deviations are not zero findings, and lines 209–210 still require repeating until explicit zero findings. After user-approved deviations, an executor could therefore continue the review loop or skip the required audit comment despite Gate 10 declaring the state terminal. Update both zero-only clauses to recognize machine PASS or user-approved Accepted Deviations.",
